<title>HONG KONG: CEPA to cease trading after Friday close.</title>
<headline>CEPA to cease trading after Friday close.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dealing in shares of Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) will cease after the close of trade on Friday, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The exchange said the listing of CEPA will be withdrawn on January 30.</p>
<p>In December, CEPA extended the Southern Co acquisition closing date due to the logistics of obtaining formally documented consents, authorisations and approvals.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
